# {{ title }}

Project generated by `opm init` ({{ vocabulary }}).

## Transform

```bash
opm transform {{ sample }} --preview
opm transform {{ sample }} -t markdown --preview
opm transform {{ sample }} -t typst -o output.typ
opm transform {{ sample }} -t docx -o output.docx
```

## Chunk and preview

```bash
opm chunk {{ sample }} --force
opm serve
```

## Customize

- Processing model: `{{ odd_path }}`
- HTML / chunk shell: `templates/{{ html_template }}.html.j2` (wired in `opm.toml`).
  Also copied, ready to swap in: `chapbook` (reading), `journal` (article with
  masthead and TOC rail), `handbook` (docs), `tufte`, `bootstrap`
- XPath extensions: `extensions/` (see `[project] pythonpath` in `opm.toml`)

